  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCharities\n\t\tFAQs\n\n### How to add accountants details in Charity accounts report\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 21 Nov, 2025 at  1:26 PM\n\n\t\tFor charities, an Accountant’s Report is not applicable.\n\nInstead, the correct document to use is the Independent Examiner’s Report, as required under charity reporting regulations.\n\nPlease use the Independent Examiner’s Report for your filing.\n\nPlease navigate to Charity module >> Client Specific >>  Accounts Production >> Independent Examiner’s Report. Once done, you can re-generate the accounts report or generate the new report.\n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance, please do not hesitate to reach out to our customer support team. We’re here to help! \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118165\">Charities</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000198578\">FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to add accountants details in Charity accounts report\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 21 Nov, 2025 at  1:26 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<ul><li data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"120\"><p data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"122\">For charities, an Accountant’s Report is not applicable.</p></li><li data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"181\"><p data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"183\">Instead, the correct document to use is the <strong data-end=\"260\" data-start=\"227\" dir=\"ltr\">Independent Examiner’s Report</strong>, as required under charity reporting regulations.</p></li><li data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"313\"><p data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"315\" dir=\"ltr\">Please use the Independent Examiner’s Report for your filing.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"315\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><br></p><div><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(25